(
    title: "Cosmic Swarm",
    description: Some("Giant mineral-eating termites have woken aboard the WAYPOINT depot, and you fly a fragile remote probe into the power chamber to clear the nest they are building. Nest blocks only fall while energized — snipe one squarely off a carrier\'s back to charge the rest red — and when fuel runs low you must break off and dock with the passing tanker, or the game ends on the spot."),
